  "rationale": "D2, calibration-only revision of D1 after its single validation look. No law changes. The aggregate validation coverage of D1's 90 % band was 0.80 and the validation ambients are mostly outside the train table, so the spread narrowed on train is widened (s_pop 0.14 -> 0.18, s_floor 0.05 -> 0.08, sigma_d 15 -> 20 um) and the radiative class made less sharp (kappa 14 -> 10). No per-run validation score or outcome was read.",
